xt":"The will-o'-wisp and its light magically become"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"invisible"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"until it attacks or uses its Consume Life, or until its concentration ends (as if concentrating on a spell)."}],"tags":122,"max_dom_depth":7}